<title>GERMANY: Schwarz Pharma 96 gp net profit up 14.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Schwarz Pharma 96 gp net profit up 14.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MONHEIM, Germany 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   103.8   up 14.4 pct</p>
<p>    Group sales				  1,195   up 17.5 pct</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (marks)	     4.49    up 20 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German pharmaceuticals group is Schwarz Pharma AG. The earnings per share figure is calculated using the DVFA analysts' method.</p>
</text>
